  "notes": "Notion-inspired warm-gray RSS reader. Sidebar uses tiny colored square letter-tiles (favicon placeholders, brand-colored per feed) and right-aligned 11px gray unread counts; category headers have chevron disclosure. Main list rows are borderless with hairline dividers; read rows turn gray in place; hovering a row reveals mark-read, star and open-original icon buttons with a blue focus outline. Clicking a row opens a right-side detail panel over a blurred backdrop (Mark as read / Star / Original, Previous/Next at bottom) — a drawer-like overlay not visible in the capture. Cmd+K opens a centered command palette ('Search feeds and articles…', Quick Actions, Keyboard Shortcuts ?). Sidebar and list scroll independently."
